      "lines": [
        "复习题"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "88",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "88. 指出下列各式的最小值：",
        "а) $|x-10|$；　　б) $|x|-10$。",
        "当变量取什么值时，上列各式分别取最小值？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "89",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "89. 证明：分式",
        "$\\frac{2a-5x}{3a-3x}+\\frac{a-5x}{4x-4a}$",
        "的值与变量的值无关（对于所有使上式有意义的变量值",
        "而言）。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "h3",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "7. 等价（同解）方程"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们知道，数和数之间的等式具有下述性质："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "1. 任何数 $a$ 等于它自身（自反性）。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "2. 如果 $a=b$，那么 $b=a$（对称性）。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "3. 如果 $a=b$，且 $b=c$，那么 $a=c$（传递性）。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "再指出等式关系的两点性质："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "4. 如果 $a=b$，且 $c$ 是任意数，那么 $a+c=b+c$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "**如果在真等式两边分别加上同一个数，那么得到的是真",
        "等式。**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "5. 如果 $a=b$，且 $c$ 是任意数，那么 $ac=bc$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "**如果在真等式的两边分别乘以同一个数，那么得到的是",
        "真等式。**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "下面我们将说明怎样利用这些性质来论证方程的等价",
        "（同解）性。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "foot",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "30"
      ]
    }
  ]
